{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLU1ldGhvZC0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDE1LSUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"The Method (TV Mini Series 2015 )","description":"Ovation TV will premiere the new original documentary The Method on Friday, March 11 with a look at two brothers who became filmmakers and then internet stars when they launched their Kuma Films YouTube channel, featuring extreme performance videos set to original music. With over 45 million views to date, Kuma Films has traveled the globe searching for incredible talent to feature on their channel and website (www.kumafilms.com). In The Method, Todd and Joe Robins take viewers to Taiwan to show what goes into creating one of their immensely popular videos. They film with fire dancers, a scooter stunt driver and a contortionist before pulling off a perilous shoot with downhill trike drifters – creating a highly immersive and shareable experience for their fans.\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLU1ldGhvZC0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDE1LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2002-09-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLU1ldGhvZC0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDE1LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2002-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLU1ldGhvZC0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDE1LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2002-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGhlLU1ldGhvZC0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDE1LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2002-10-01T